Subject: [PATCH] Store door-face verification without new sample URL columns.

Add hand-run SQL for style verification and the original combined image. Public styles stay visible until that SQL runs, new styles are unverified once it does, and room scenes skip unverified or combined swatches. The audit includes the drawer sample and skips styles that still need a door-only photo.

Exported from 98d068e. The SQL script is numbered 0226 so it does not clash with 0225_vendor_forecast_rates.
